## 1. Structured JSON Generation via Gemini API

### 1.1 The Challenge of LLM Hallucinations in Database Migrations
In database migrations, an unconstrained LLM response (e.g. returning markdown commentary, missing fields, or invalid SQL types like `STRING` instead of `VARCHAR(255)`) can crash the frontend parser or corrupt the target database schema.

### 1.2 The Solution: Strict Schema Enforcement (`response_schema`)
By utilizing the Gemini API's native `response_mime_type: "application/json"` and `response_schema`, the model is mathematically constrained to generate valid, parseable JSON conforming to our TypeScript interfaces.

* **Schema Definition Schema (OpenAPI / Gemini format):**
```json
{
  "type": "OBJECT",
  "properties": {
    "tables": {
      "type": "ARRAY",
      "items": {
        "type": "OBJECT",
        "properties": {
          "name": { "type": "STRING" },
          "description": { "type": "STRING" },
          "columns": {
            "type": "ARRAY",
            "items": {
              "type": "OBJECT",
              "properties": {
                "name": { "type": "STRING" },
                "sourceField": { "type": "STRING" },
                "dataType": { "type": "STRING" },
                "isNullable": { "type": "BOOLEAN" },
                "isPrimaryKey": { "type": "BOOLEAN" },
                "foreignKey": {
                  "type": "OBJECT",
                  "properties": {
                    "referencesTable": { "type": "STRING" },
                    "referencesColumn": { "type": "STRING" }
                  }
                },
                "transformation": { "type": "STRING" }
              },
              "required": ["name", "sourceField", "dataType", "isNullable", "isPrimaryKey"]
            }
          }
        },
        "required": ["name", "columns"]
      }
    },
    "risks": {
      "type": "ARRAY",
      "items": {
        "type": "OBJECT",
        "properties": {
          "severity": { "type": "STRING", "enum": ["CRITICAL", "WARNING", "INFO"] },
          "title": { "type": "STRING" },
          "description": { "type": "STRING" },
          "suggestedFix": { "type": "STRING" }
        },
        "required": ["severity", "title", "description", "suggestedFix"]
      }
    }
  },
  "required": ["tables", "risks"]
}
```

